# The build image `scripts/package.sh` builds the release in, as a registry
# reference fixed by digest, for example
#
#   ghcr.io/lucas-brt/smart-commit-build@sha256:...
#
# With a reference here, package.sh pulls that image: no `apt`, no package
# snapshot, the same C toolchain for everyone. Without one (as long as the
# image has not been published) it builds the image from scripts/build/Dockerfile,
# which needs snapshot.ubuntu.com. SMART_COMMIT_BUILD_IMAGE overrides this file
# with any image, local or not. See docs/reproducibility.md for how the image
# is published and this line updated.
